        {
          "url": "https://www.wamplerpedals.com/products/distortion-overdrive/wampler-black-65/",
          "host": "www.wamplerpedals.com",
          "title": "Black ’65 Limited Edition | Wampler Pedals",
          "h1": "Black ’65 Limited Edition",
          "description": "There was something almost magical about certain amplifiers from the 1960’s. Wampler’s Black ‘65 pedal captures the tonal nuances and rich harmonics associated with this classic era!",
          "snippet": "Black &#x27;65 Limited Edition - Wampler Pedals",
          "bodyExcerpt": "Black ’65 Limited Edition | Wampler Pedals Home Shop All Pedals Distortion / Overdrive Compression Fuzz Delay / Reverb Modulation Boost Utilities Discontinued Plugins Merchandise Dealers Community Blog Artists Podcast Videos Support About Downloads FAQs Warranty Registration Withdrawal Request Contact Us search account_circle My Account search Products search Black ’65 Limited Edition There was something almost magical about certain amplifiers from the 1960’s. Wampler’s Black ‘65 pedal captures the tonal nuances and rich harmonics associated with this classic era! Out of stock Watch video Overview Features Videos Technical Downloads Out of stock &#8220;While the world moves increasingly toward digital modeling, these analog circuits offer something uniquely compelling.&#8221; Right facing | Front | Left facing | Back | Top |' data-navmenu=\"off\" data-hashurl=\"off\" data-menuSlider=\"off\" data-continue-autoplay=\"off\" data-outside-nav=\"off\" data-autoplay=\"off\" > 4 5 There was something magical about certain amps from the 1960s, amps that have become to be known as the \"blackface\" or \"black panel\" style of amplifiers from a certain legendary American guitar and amplifier company. With such a rich legacy of tone to follow, Grand Pappy BDub’s take on the American-voiced amps of that period was turned into the legendary Black ‘65 Pedal. Through a clean amp, this pedal offers a faithful reproduction of the tones Brian loved from this classic period, and it is also flexible enough to add a new level of nuanced grit to your existing rig. This is a limited edition pedal and only available to purchase online here from Wamplerpedals.com. Once they’re gone, they’re gone! &#36; 199.97 Out of stock SKU: WMP-B65-PED Category: Distortion / Overdrive Tags: AIAB , Amp , Black 65 warning Cancer and Reproductive Harm www.p65warnings.ca.gov Limited Edition, Classic Tones Although the Black ’65 delivers the sound of those vintage tones you have come 