          "title": "Wampler Pedals Brad Paisley: Paisley Deluxe | AllThePedals",
          "h1": "Brad Paisley: Paisley Deluxe",
          "description": "The Wampler Paisley Deluxe is a dual overdrive pedal designed in collaboration with Brad Paisley, combining the [Paisley Drive](/pedals/wampler-pedals-brad-paisley-paisley-drive) and Underdog circuits. This pedal offers exceptional versatility with independent access to both overdrive tones, allowing users to stack them or use them individually. Its design is ideal for various musical styles, providing a wide range of overdrive options and is particularly well-suited for use with a Telecaster.",
          "snippet": "Wampler Pedals Brad Paisley: Paisley Deluxe | AllThePedals",
          "bodyExcerpt": "Wampler Pedals Brad Paisley: Paisley Deluxe | AllThePedals Articles Genealogy Browse Search results for &quot; &quot; Gain / Overdrive / Wampler Pedals Brad Paisley: Paisley Deluxe Brad Paisley: Paisley Deluxe The Wampler Paisley Deluxe is a dual overdrive pedal designed in collaboration with Brad Paisley, combining the Paisley Drive and Underdog circuits. This pedal offers exceptional versatility with independent access to both overdrive tones, allowing users to stack them or use them individually. Its design is ideal for various musical styles, providing a wide range of overdrive options and is particularly well-suited for use with a Telecaster. What Wampler Pedals say about the Brad Paisley: Paisley Deluxe Wampler&#x27;s relationship with Brad Paisley goes back to a time way before his signature Paisley Drive pedal. In fact, thanks to the way it produced similar tones to the lauded Nobels ODR-S with more control for fine-tuning his sound, the first Wampler pedal Brad fell in love with was the since-discontinued Underdog overdrive. It&#x27;s with this in mind that Wampler combined Brad&#x27;s two favorite Wampler tones in the Paisley Deluxe dual overdrive pedal. By cramming a Paisley Drive and Brian&#x27;s Underdog circuits into a single pedal, Wampler is delivering the ultimate Brad Paisley pedal. Not only do you have independent access to both tones, but you are able to stack them for more harmonically rich drive in any order you want. And taking a cue from Wampler&#x27;s popular Tom Quayle signature Dual Fusion&#x27;s groundbreaking signal routing, you&#x27;re able to run each side of the Paisley Deluxe as an individual pedal, perfect for today&#x27;s pedal switcher-based rigs. Whether you&#x27;re looking to nail Brad&#x27;s gorgeous signature tones or are looking for a great-sounding overdrive with unbelievable flexibility, you can&#x27;t go wrong with the Wampler Paisley Deluxe. This is not just a pedal for country music, with more gain available that you can possibly imagine, the Paisley Deluxe will slot into any rig and give you all the overdrive options you could ever want! www.wamplerpedals.com What guitarists say... Customers praised the Wampler Paisley Deluxe for its versatility and ability to produce rich, clear tones, especially with a Telecaster. Users loved the pedal, calling it the best overdrive they&#x27;ve used. Read reviews on www.wamplerpedals.com Brad Paisley: Paisley Deluxe compared to ... Brad Paisley: Paisley Deluxe Wampler Pedals Link Brad Paisley: Paisley Deluxe Type Overdrive - Popularity - Average Price - Status Unknown - Genealogy Our Genealogy Project attempts to create a family tree of all gain effects by mapping the pedal(s) that directly preceded them. From our pedal geneology project Rangemaster Treble Booster LPB-1 MICRO AMP+ PRE-1 Preamp/Booster Brad Paisley: Paisley Deluxe Wampler Pedals Brad Paisley: Paisley Deluxe Family Tree Rangemaster Treble Booster LPB-1 MICRO AMP+ PRE-1 Preamp/Booster Brad Paisley: Paisley Deluxe All The Pedals Newsletter Sign up to our newsletter too for monthly news and articles in the world of guitar effects pedals. Subscribe About Browse Pedals Search Cookies Terms Privacy Contact",
