          "snippet": "Wampler Pedals Clarksdale Overdrive Guitar Effect Pedal",
          "bodyExcerpt": "Wampler Pedals Clarksdale Overdrive Guitar Effect Pedal for sale online | eBay Skip to main content Hi ! Hi! Sign in or register Deals Brand Outlet Help Contact Sell Watchlist Expand Watch List My eBay Expand My eBay Summary Recently Viewed Bids/Offers Watchlist Purchase History Buy Again Selling Saved Feed Saved Searches Saved Sellers Payments My Garage Preferences My Collection Messages PSA Vault Issue Resolution Center Notifications Loading... Expand Cart Loading... eBay Home Shop by category All Categories Search Advanced breadcrumb eBay Books, Movies Music Musical Instruments Gear Guitars Basses Parts Accessories Books, Movies Music Musical Instruments Gear Guitars Basses Parts Accessories Effects Pedals Distortion Overdrive CURRENTLY SOLD OUT Wampler Pedals Clarksdale Overdrive Guitar Effect Pedal 4.8 5 product ratings | About this product About this product Product Information Go into an overdrive and enthrall the audience with your mesmerizing guitar works using the Wampler Pedals Clarksdale Guitar Effect Pedal. With ergonomic controls like True By-Pass Relay, Volume, Gain, Smooth/ Lift, Bass, Mids, and Treble, the pedal allows you to adjust the tone of your instrument as desired. This battery-powered pedal features a 1/4-inch input and 1/4-inch output jack connector for convenient usage. Product Identifiers Brand Wampler Pedals UPC 0857527003270 Model Clarksdale eBay Product ID (ePID) 215746896 Product Key Features Type Overdrive Dimensions Depth 4.5in Additional Product Features Power Supply Battery, DC Adapter Show More Show Less Ratings and Reviews Learn more 4.8 5 product ratings 5 4 users rated this 5 out of 5 stars 4 4 1 users rated this 4 out of 5 stars 1 3 0 users rated this 3 out of 5 stars 0 2 0 users rated this 2 out of 5 stars 0 1 0 users rated this 1 out of 5 stars 0 Would recommend Good value Enjoyable Most relevant reviews by 1949-tele Nov 07, 2015 Wampler Pedals First let me say that I have 5 Wampler pedals. They are a little pricy but truly serve the purpose they were designed for . . . With the CLARKSDALE the sound of Blues and Rock Roll that I was raised on is there at a twist. Albert King to SRV. Neil Young to The Stones. With this pedal I can dial in the exact amount of grind that I need. I can make my cleans have a little SWEET spot OR I can dial in the DIRT - GRIND - Or get right n the GUTTER. You can't put a price on TONE and you can't go wrong with a trip to the crossroads with the CLARKSDALE ! ! ! Verified purchase: Yes Condition: New by classicrocker Apr 02, 2018 Wampler Clarksdale Overdrive I've heard good things about this pedal for a couple of years now, so when one came up at a great price I jumped on it. I like the Tube Screamer for light OD or to drive the front end of my amp into saturation when it's set for high output and low drive. The Clarksdale replaces a Mini TS on the front end of my pedal board. The Clarksdale is essentially a clone of the Tube Screamer, built with high quality parts and modified to include an active Bass and Mids control in addition to the regular Treble found in the TS. It also offers more gain, and overall sounds WAY better than the TS does. On top of that there's a switch that puts the sound over the top for lead work. It's also pretty quiet hiss wise for an overdrive. It's a great pedal, and I recommend it. Verified purchase: Yes Condition: New by stephendavidmccarthy Aug 01, 2018 wampler clarksdale overdrive. Fab pedal. Perfect TS sound. Verified purchase: Yes Condition: Pre-owned by truck8141 Dec 04, 2016 Fabulous pedal, so versatile Took a chance buying having never heard it. Man I am impressed goes from mild to heavy crunch in one pedal. It's a keeper Verified purchase: Yes Condition: Pre-owned More items related to this product Wampler Clarksdale Delta Overdrive Pedal item 1 Wampler Clarksdale Delta Overdrive Pedal $90.00 +$6.57 shipping Wampler Clarksdale Delta Overdrive Pedal item 2 Wampler Clarksdale Delta Overdrive Pedal $115.00 Wampler clarksdal",
