          "description": "A rigorous, measurement-informed review of the Wampler Leviathan Fuzz — examining its dual-mode architecture, harmonic saturation behavior, input impedance (1.2 MΩ), output headroom (+18.3 dBu at unity gain), and real-world performance alongside vintage and modern fuzzes including the Big Muff Pi, Fuzz Face, and EarthQuaker Devices Hoof.",
