          "description": "First there was the Plexi-Drive. Then there was the Plexi-Drive Deluxe. Now Wampler Pedals brings you the all new Plexi-Drive Mini. Brian has managed to cram an improved version of the original Plexi-Drive circuit into a miniature housing and even added some new features.",
          "snippet": "Plexi Drive Mini - Wampler Pedals",
          "bodyExcerpt": "Plexi Drive Mini | Wampler Pedals Home Shop All Pedals Distortion / Overdrive Compression Fuzz Delay / Reverb Modulation Boost Utilities Discontinued Plugins Merchandise Dealers Community Blog Artists Podcast Videos Support About Downloads FAQs Warranty Registration Withdrawal Request Contact Us search account_circle My Account search Products search Plexi Drive Mini Wampler’s “British Voiced Amp” style distortion gets a reboot… The ultimate mini pedal for classic rock and metal fans. In stock Plexi Drive Mini quantity Add to cart Watch video Overview Features Videos Technical Downloads In stock Plexi Drive Mini quantity Add to cart &#8220;The Mini Plexi Drive. Same Fet based circuit as the original but with some tonal tweaking in a mini pedal&#8221; Right facing | Front | Left facing | Back | Top |' data-navmenu=\"off\" data-hashurl=\"off\" data-menuSlider=\"off\" data-continue-autoplay=\"off\" data-outside-nav=\"off\" data-autoplay=\"off\" > 4 5 First there was the Plexi-Drive. Then there was the Plexi-Drive Deluxe. Now Wampler Pedals brings you the all new Plexi-Drive Mini. Brian has managed to cram an improved version of the original Plexi-Drive circuit into a miniature housing and even added some new features. Since the early 60’s, Marshall Amplifiers® have led the way in rock tones with legendary crunch and punchy bass response. Early rock legends such as: Jimi Hendrix, Led Zeppelin, Cream, and AC/DC helped in creating some of the most iconic rock tones ever and catapulted Marshall® into legendary status. Like the original, the Plexi-Drive Mini’s unique gain structure covers everything from Vintage ’68 style Plexi tones to the all-out massive rock tones of a JTM-45® cranked to ten, or even eleven… The all-new Mid Boost circuit switch, never featured on any previous Wampler Plexi style pedal, creates a powerful throaty tube-like boost by tweaking several gain stages of the circuit at once. The combination of these switches with the Tone and Gain controls offer impressive tonal flexibility from a mini pedal. Many players love to run Tumnus, Clarksdale and other OD type pedals into the Plexi-Drive or Plexi-Drive Deluxe. For the Plexi-Drive Mini, Brian implemented gain stage and EQ changes within the mid boost circuit to achieve a similar response - the result is astounding, and with masses of gain on tap, things are about to get loud! The Plexi Drive Mini also features our special Bass Boost switch which emulates the tonal difference between a 4x12 and 2x12 speaker cab. &#36; 149.97 In stock Plexi Drive Mini quantity Add to cart SKU: WMP-PDE-PED Category: Distortion / Overdrive Tags: distortion , overdrive , Plexi warning Cancer and Reproductive Harm www.p65warnings.ca.gov All new Mid Boost, Classic Bass Boost The all-new Mid Boost circuit switch, never featured on any previous Wampler Plexi style pedal, creates a powerful throaty tube-like boost by tweaking several gain stages of the circuit at once. The Plexi Drive Mini also features our special Bass Boost switch which emulates the tonal difference between a 4×12 and 2×12 speaker cab. Classic Plexi Tones Brian Wampler’s attention to detail and commitment to designing the best and most player-friendly products out there are second to none. Like its bigger brother, the Plexi-Drive deluxe, the Plexi-Drive Mini’s unique gain structure covers everything from Vintage ’68 style Plexi tones to the all-out massive rock tones of a British Voiced amp cranked to ten, or even eleven… Tone Stack Many players love to run Tumnus, Clarksdale and other OD type pedals into the Plexi-Drive or Plexi-Drive Deluxe. For the Plexi-Drive Mini, Brian implemented gain stage and EQ changes within the mid boost circuit to achieve a similar response – the result is astounding, and with masses of gain on tap, things are about to get loud! Built for Forever! Brian Wampler’s attention to detail and commitment to bringing you the best-sounding most usable Effects Boxes on the market is nothing new. Those qualities are",
