          "h1": "WAY HUGE® SMALLS™ GEISHA DRIVE",
          "description": "wm32, way huge smalls geisha drive, way huge, way huge smalls, geisha drive, overdrive pedal, distortion pedal, guitar effects, stompbox, guitar pedal, jim dunlop",
          "snippet": "WAY HUGE® SMALLS™ GEISHA DRIVE - Dunlop",
          "bodyExcerpt": "WAY HUGE® SMALLS™ GEISHA DRIVE Toggle menu Compare --> Register I Sign in Search Bag Search Close Products --> All Products --> --> Electronics MXR Cry Baby Way Huge Dunlop Electronics Authentic Hendrix Pedal Parts Electronic Parts Legacy Products Guitar Picks Tortex Nylon Max-Grip Jazz Herco Gator Grip Celluloid Ultex Primetone Delrin 500 Flow Finger Thumb Stubby Variety Packs Artist Series Graphic Artist Series Pick Tins Other Clearance Accessories Capos Slides Tonebars MXR Cables Care Maintenance Strap Retainer Straps Tuners Pick Holders GrooveTech Tools Accu-Fret Fretwire Clearance Strings Artist Series Electric Bass Acoustic Classical Americana Ukulele Apparel Shirts Hoodies Hats Artists Lifestyle Sign in WAY HUGE® SMALLS™ GEISHA DRIVE WM32 Description The Way Huge Smalls Geisha Drive creates a wide range of dynamic, touch-sensitive tones that can be dialed in from overdrive to distortion territory by adjusting your guitar&rsquo;s volume knob. Warranty Information The Long Story A RETURN TO THE STAGE! The Way Huge Smalls Geisha Drive creates a wide range of dynamic, touch-sensitive tones that can be dialed in from overdrive to distortion territory by adjusting your guitar’s volume knob. This pedal’s simple circuit allows the personality of you and your guitar to shine through. On the outside is a straightforward three-knob control setup. But they conjure up gritty, grinding tones that are as potent as they are versatile, and they’re shaped by the intensity of your attack and the volume of your guitar. At low Drive settings, you'll get a warm, buttery goodness with a bit of velvet around the edges. Midways gets you thick, tubey overdrive. Start cranking that Drive knob towards the end of the range, and you'll have gnarly thunder-and-lightning distortion. Use the Tone knob to brighten it up or mellow it out, and get as loud as you want to be with the Volume knob. Works well with an absolute clean amp or already overdriven amp on the edge! The Way Huge Smalls Geisha Drive is a special limited edition offering featuring colorful artwork with Japanese katakana writing. Product Demo Product Manual Current Stock: atc-product: 2270 atc-product: 2362 atc-product: 1619 Related Gear WAY HUGE® SMALLS™ GEISHA DRIVE BLUE WM32B Choose Options WAY HUGE® SMALLS™ GEISHA DRIVE BLUE - PARTS WM32B-PARTS $0.00 WAY HUGE® GEISHA DRIVE WHE211K WAY HUGE® SMALLS™ RED LLAMA WM23 WAY HUGE® SMALLS™ STO OVERDRIVE WM25 &#215; OK About Careers Contact Site Feedback Support Store Locator Gear Support My Account Product Registration Custom Picks Legal Statement of Accessibility Copyrights Trademarks Terms Conditions Icon Agreement Contest Rules Popular Brands MXR CRY BABY DUNLOP ELECTRONICS MXR BASS INNOVATIONS MXR CUSTOM SHOP WAY HUGE CRYBABY DUNLOP JIM DUNLOP CAE View All --> STAY IN TOUCH. &copy; 2026 Dunlop Manufacturing, Inc.",
