          "snippet": "WAY HUGE® GEISHA DRIVE - Dunlop",
          "bodyExcerpt": "WAY HUGE® GEISHA DRIVE - Dunlop Toggle menu Compare --> Register I Sign in Search Bag Search Close Products --> All Products --> --> Electronics MXR Cry Baby Way Huge Dunlop Electronics Authentic Hendrix Pedal Parts Electronic Parts Legacy Products Guitar Picks Tortex Nylon Max-Grip Jazz Herco Gator Grip Celluloid Ultex Primetone Delrin 500 Flow Finger Thumb Stubby Variety Packs Artist Series Graphic Artist Series Pick Tins Other Clearance Accessories Capos Slides Tonebars MXR Cables Care Maintenance Strap Retainer Straps Tuners Pick Holders GrooveTech Tools Accu-Fret Fretwire Clearance Strings Artist Series Electric Bass Acoustic Classical Americana Ukulele Apparel Shirts Hoodies Hats Artists Lifestyle Sign in WAY HUGE® GEISHA DRIVE WHE211K Description *LEGACY PRODUCT / NO LONGER IN PRODUCTION The Way Huge Geisha Drive is a special edition of the Way Huge Drive. Limited to 40 pieces, each pedal has been assembled, dated, serial numbered, and signed by Jeorge Tripps' own hand. Warranty Information The Long Story The Way Huge Geisha Drive is a special edition of the Way Huge Drive. Limited to 40 pieces, each pedal has been assembled, dated, serial numbered, and signed by Jeorge Tripps' own hand. The housing features colorful artwork with Japanese writing from the early prototype stage. On the inside of this pedal is the Way Huge Drive's limited edition circuit, offering potent, versatile OD and distortion tones that can be moved and shaped by the intensity of your attack and the volume of your guitar. At low Drive settings, you'll get a warm, buttery sound with a bit of velvet around the edges. Midways gets you thick, tubey overdrive. Start cranking that Drive knob towards the end of the range, and you'll have gnarly thunder and lightning distortion. Use the Tone knob to brighten it up or mellow it out, and use the Volume knob to be as loud as you wanna be. Built by Jeorge Tripps while sheltered at home over the weekend of April 4th and April 5th, 2020, this pedal is only available from jimdunlop.com, and we won't be making anymore. This is it! Get yours while we have them. Feed Product Manual Current Stock: atc-product: 2156 atc-product: 2270 atc-product: 2362 Related Gear WAY HUGE® SMALLS™ GEISHA DRIVE WM32 WAY HUGE® SMALLS™ GEISHA DRIVE BLUE WM32B Choose Options WAY HUGE® SMALLS™ GEISHA DRIVE BLUE - PARTS WM32B-PARTS $0.00 Choose Options WAY HUGE® DRIVE - PARTS WHE302GB-PARTS $0.00 WAY HUGE® OVERDRIVE WHE205OD &#215; OK About Careers Contact Site Feedback Support Store Locator Gear Support My Account Product Registration Custom Picks Legal Statement of Accessibility Copyrights Trademarks Terms Conditions Icon Agreement Contest Rules Popular Brands MXR CRY BABY DUNLOP ELECTRONICS MXR BASS INNOVATIONS MXR CUSTOM SHOP WAY HUGE CRYBABY DUNLOP JIM DUNLOP CAE View All --> STAY IN TOUCH. &copy; 2026 Dunlop Manufacturing, Inc.",
