          "description": "whe407, way huge jumbo fuzz swollen pickle xxx, way huge, swollen pickle pedal, xxx pedal, jumbo fuzz, fuzz, fuzz pedal, jim dunlop, dunlop fuzz pedal, stompbox, guitar pedal, effects pedal, fuzz guitar",
          "snippet": "Way Huge® Jumbo Fuzz Swollen Pickle® Xxx",
          "bodyExcerpt": "WAY HUGE® JUMBO FUZZ SWOLLEN PICKLE® XXX Toggle menu Compare --> Register I Sign in Search Bag Search Close Products --> All Products --> --> Electronics MXR Cry Baby Way Huge Dunlop Electronics Authentic Hendrix Pedal Parts Electronic Parts Legacy Products Guitar Picks Tortex Nylon Max-Grip Jazz Herco Gator Grip Celluloid Ultex Primetone Delrin 500 Flow Finger Thumb Stubby Variety Packs Artist Series Graphic Artist Series Pick Tins Other Clearance Accessories Capos Slides Tonebars MXR Cables Care Maintenance Strap Retainer Straps Tuners Pick Holders GrooveTech Tools Accu-Fret Fretwire Clearance Strings Artist Series Electric Bass Acoustic Classical Americana Ukulele Apparel Shirts Hoodies Hats Artists Lifestyle Sign in WAY HUGE® JUMBO FUZZ SWOLLEN PICKLE® XXX WHE407 Description *LEGACY PRODUCT / NO LONGER IN PRODUCTION Celebrating its 30th spin around the sun, the Way Huge Jumbo Fuzz Swollen Pickle XXX seethes and simmers with high-gain saturation and fat, hairy lows, but the ever-madder mad scientist Mister Huge has made some ethically questionable but sonically enlightened tweaks to enhance your control over the pedal&rsquo;s sound. Warranty Information The Long Story The most corpulent of fuzzes is celebrating its 30th spin around the sun with a sweet new take on its crushing and humongous tone. The Way Huge Jumbo Fuzz Swollen Pickle XXX seethes and simmers with high-gain saturation and fat, hairy lows, but the ever-madder mad scientist Mister Huge has made some ethically questionable but sonically enlightened tweaks to enhance your control over the pedal’s sound. First, he replaced the traditional transistor array with high-gain discrete transistors for even more HAIR. Next, he changed out the Crunch knob for a toggle switch to make compression tweaks lightning fast. Finally, Mister Huge massively overhauled the tone stack from top to bottom: new Hi and Lo knobs shape the high- and low-pass of the Filter control, while internal switches let players customize the sweep itself—from flat to ultra scooped or super bumped—giving you ever more intimate control over this surly cucumber’s voice. The Loudness and Sustain controls return to clobber your amp and set the fuzz intensity from mild crunch to end-of-days hellfire. Celebrate 30 years in the burliest and grimiest of brines with the Way Huge Jumbo Fuzz Swollen Pickle XXX. Available for a limited time only with fittingly wacky special edition artwork—get yours while supplies last! Product Manual Current Stock: atc-product: 2309 atc-product: 2307 atc-product: 1773 Related Gear Add to Bag MXR® 15 FT COIL GLOW INSTRUMENT CABLE - RIGHT / STRAIGHT DCICG15R $36.74 Decrease Quantity: Increase Quantity: Add to Bag MXR® 15 FT COIL CABLE BLACK - RIGHT / STRAIGHT DCICB15R $30.44 Decrease Quantity: Increase Quantity: Add to Bag MXR® 6 INCH RIBBON PATCH CABLE - 3 PACK 3PDCPR06 $26.24 Decrease Quantity: Increase Quantity: Add to Bag WAY HUGE® SMALLS™ SWOLLEN PICKLE® FUZZ WM41 $159.99 Decrease Quantity: Increase Quantity: Add to Bag MXR® MINI ISO-BRICK™ POWER SUPPLY M239 $105.99 Decrease Quantity: Increase Quantity: Add to Bag MXR® ISO-BRICK™ POWER SUPPLY M238 $179.99 Decrease Quantity: Increase Quantity: Add to Bag MXR® 15 FT STANDARD INSTRUMENT CABLE - STRAIGHT / STRAIGHT DCIS15 $20.99 Decrease Quantity: Increase Quantity: Out of stock WAY HUGE® SMALLS™ PORK PICKLE™ OVERDRIVE FUZZ WM91 $199.99 Add to Bag WAY HUGE® SWOLLEN PICKLE® JUMBO FUZZ MKIIS WHE401S $159.99 Decrease Quantity: Increase Quantity: &#215; OK About Careers Contact Site Feedback Support Store Locator Gear Support My Account Product Registration Custom Picks Legal Statement of Accessibility Copyrights Trademarks Terms Conditions Icon Agreement Contest Rules Popular Brands MXR CRY BABY DUNLOP ELECTRONICS MXR BASS INNOVATIONS MXR CUSTOM SHOP WAY HUGE CRYBABY DUNLOP JIM DUNLOP CAE View All --> STAY IN TOUCH. &copy; 2026 Dunlop Manufacturing, Inc.",
