          "snippet": "WAY HUGE® SMALLS™ OVERRATED SPECIAL™ OVERDRIVE - Dunlop",
          "bodyExcerpt": "WAY HUGE® SMALLS™ OVERRATED SPECIAL™ OVERDRIVE - Dunlop Toggle menu Compare --> Register I Sign in Search Bag Search Close Products --> All Products --> --> Electronics MXR Cry Baby Way Huge Dunlop Electronics Authentic Hendrix Pedal Parts Electronic Parts Legacy Products Guitar Picks Tortex Nylon Max-Grip Jazz Herco Gator Grip Celluloid Ultex Primetone Delrin 500 Flow Finger Thumb Stubby Variety Packs Artist Series Graphic Artist Series Pick Tins Other Clearance Accessories Capos Slides Tonebars MXR Cables Care Maintenance Strap Retainer Straps Tuners Pick Holders GrooveTech Tools Accu-Fret Fretwire Clearance Strings Artist Series Electric Bass Acoustic Classical Americana Ukulele Apparel Shirts Hoodies Hats Artists Lifestyle Sign in WAY HUGE® SMALLS™ OVERRATED SPECIAL™ OVERDRIVE WM28 Description *LEGACY PRODUCT / NO LONGER IN PRODUCTION Get the same range of bold, punchy grit in a Way Huge Smalls housing so you can save some space on your pedalboard. This pedal can be powered by a 9-volt battery, a Dunlop ECB003 9-volt adapter, or the DC Brick™, Iso-Brick™, and Mini Iso-Brick™ power supplies (not included). Warranty Information The Long Story Designed in conjunction with bluesman Joe Bonamassa, the Way Huge Smalls Overrated Special Overdrive delivers a range of bold, punchy grit. Jeorge Tripps took an old school Green Rhino OD, hot-rodded it for a more pronounced midrange, and added a Freq control so that you can punch up the low mids. Volume, Tone, and Drive controls round out a straightforward user interface so you can plug in and get right to it. Run the Overrated Special OD in front of a clean amp for a gritty boost, or slam an already distorted channel for an electrifying surge of gain and sustain worthy of Joe Bonamassa's searing leads. Now in a Way Huge Smalls housing, this little box of dirt will find an easy home on your pedalboard. Product Demo Feed Product Manual Current Stock: atc-product: 2129 atc-product: 744 atc-product: 16