          "snippet": "Way Huge® Smalls™ Conspiracy Theory™ Professional Overdrive",
          "bodyExcerpt": "WAY HUGE® SMALLS™ CONSPIRACY THEORY™ PROFESSIONAL OVERDRIVE - Dunlop Toggle menu Compare --> Register I Sign in Search Bag Search Close Products --> All Products --> --> Electronics MXR Cry Baby Way Huge Dunlop Electronics Authentic Hendrix Pedal Parts Electronic Parts Legacy Products Guitar Picks Tortex Nylon Max-Grip Jazz Herco Gator Grip Celluloid Ultex Primetone Delrin 500 Flow Finger Thumb Stubby Variety Packs Artist Series Graphic Artist Series Pick Tins Other Clearance Accessories Capos Slides Tonebars MXR Cables Care Maintenance Strap Retainer Straps Tuners Pick Holders GrooveTech Tools Accu-Fret Fretwire Clearance Strings Artist Series Electric Bass Acoustic Classical Americana Ukulele Apparel Shirts Hoodies Hats Artists Lifestyle Sign in WAY HUGE® SMALLS™ CONSPIRACY THEORY™ PROFESSIONAL OVERDRIVE WM20 Description This mystical little device infuses your guitar signal with rich harmonics for smooth, transparent overdrive, with Gain, Volume, and Treble controls making for a super straightforward command center. This pedal can be powered by a 9-volt battery, a Dunlop ECB003 9-volt adapter, or the DC Brick™, Iso-Brick™, and Mini Iso-Brick™ power supplies (not included). Warranty Information The Long Story This is the overdrive pedal that THEY don't want you to know about! Developed in total secrecy by a shadowy organization embedded deep within the deepest of states, the Way Huge Smalls Conspiracy Theory Professional Overdrive is reported to bring forth unparalleled sonic delight. They say it relies on alien technology bestowed upon our ancient forebears, producing a sound so dazzling that it generates a heatless auditory light that will liberate the consciousness of any guitarist who kicks it on. Adjusting the Gain control initiates a form of fusion heretofore unknown to science, bonding rich harmonics with your guitar signal to create smooth, transparent overdrive. Use the Volume and Treble controls to set just how far your signal penetrates the furthest reaches of the universe and what it's shape is when it gets there. Thanks to a rather harrowing clandestine operation, we can grant you the ability to harness the mythical power of the Conspiracy Theory Professional Overdrive right on your pedalboard. Product Demo In The News MusicRadar.com: Way Huge debuts Conspiracy Theory Professional Overdrive pedal Feed Product Manual $159.99 USD --> Current Stock: Quantity: Decrease Quantity: Increase Quantity: Add to Bag atc-product: 2309 atc-product: 2307 atc-product: 1987 Related Gear Add to Bag MXR® 15 FT COIL GLOW INSTRUMENT CABLE - RIGHT / STRAIGHT DCICG15R $36.74 Decrease Quantity: Increase Quantity: Add to Bag MXR® 15 FT COIL CABLE BLACK - RIGHT / STRAIGHT DCICB15R $30.44 Decrease Quantity: Increase Quantity: Add to Bag MXR® 18-INCH RIBBON PATCH CABLE DCPR018 $12.59 Decrease Quantity: Increase Quantity: Add to Bag MXR® 3 FOOT TRS RIBBON PATCH CABLE DCISTR3RR $19.94 Decrease Quantity: Increase Quantity: Add to Bag MXR® 1 FOOT TRS RIBBON PATCH CABLE DCISTR1RR $15.74 Decrease Quantity: Increase Quantity: Add to Bag MXR® 3 INCH TRS RIBBON PATCH CABLE - 3 PACK 3PDCISTR03R $29.39 Decrease Quantity: Increase Quantity: Add to Bag MXR® 6 IN PATCH CABLE - 1 PACK DCP06SI $10.49 Decrease Quantity: Increase Quantity: Add to Bag MXR® 3 FT PATCH CABLE DCP3 $15.74 Decrease Quantity: Increase Quantity: Add to Bag MXR® 1 FT PATCH CABLE DCP1 $11.54 Decrease Quantity: Increase Quantity: Out of stock MXR® 6 IN PATCH CABLE 3-PACK 3PDCP06 $20.99 &#215; OK About Careers Contact Site Feedback Support Store Locator Gear Support My Account Product Registration Custom Picks Legal Statement of Accessibility Copyrights Trademarks Terms Conditions Icon Agreement Contest Rules Popular Brands MXR CRY BABY DUNLOP ELECTRONICS MXR BASS INNOVATIONS MXR CUSTOM SHOP WAY HUGE CRYBABY DUNLOP JIM DUNLOP CAE View All --> STAY IN TOUCH. &copy; 2026 Dunlop Manufacturing, Inc.",
